OL,3,GNEWSASingle elected mayor to cover all
OL,4,ADevon in 2028
OL,5,
OL,6,FDevon will get an elected mayor in
OL,7,F2028, it has been announced in the
OL,8,FBudget.
OL,10,FThe position will be a figurehead for
OL,11,Fthe county, which is split into three
OL,12,Fadministrative areas: Devon County
OL,13,FCouncil, and the Plymouth City Council
OL,14,Fand Torbay Council unitary authorities.
OL,16,FDevon leaders previously said they were
OL,17,Fkeen to work with Cornwall on a joint
OL,18,Fmayoral authority, but Cornwall
OL,19,Fresisted that approach, with its
OL,20,Funitary authority saying it was now "by
OL,21,Fexception" a "single strategic
OL,22,Fauthority".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
