OL,3,GNEWSASingle elected mayor to cover all
OL,4,ADevon in 2028
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government had been trying to
OL,7,Fmanage a reorganisation of local
OL,8,Fgovernment with the abolition of all
OL,9,Fcouncils in Devon to be replaced by
OL,10,Funitary councils but that plan has been
OL,11,Fput on hold.
